WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.492
Public benchmarks can reveal broad capabilities, but they do not automatically predict performance on your workflow.

00:00:07.492 --> 00:00:14.622
Your application may care about format compliance, refusal behavior, private terminology, latency,

00:00:14.622 --> 00:00:19.882
or a specific failure cost that the benchmark never measures.

00:00:19.882 --> 00:00:23.162
A leaderboard can help shortlist candidates.

00:00:23.162 --> 00:00:27.507
Your own evaluation determines whether a candidate belongs in your system.
